## Scope of this license

This license covers the source code in this repository: the engine modules in
`src/`, the verification script in `scripts/`, the page markup and styles, and
the build configuration.

It does **not** grant any right to the visual assets under `public/textures/`
and `dist/textures/`. Those images were generated for this project, and the
commercial terms of the generation platform used are still unconfirmed. They
are included for personal technical demonstration only and must not be treated
as commercially licensable. Anyone reusing this repository must replace those
image files with assets they have the right to use.

No third-party artwork is bundled. See the "项目边界声明" section in README.md
for the full statement.
